    "body_html": "<style>\n  .ccc-pd { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1c1c1c; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 680px; }\n  .ccc-pd p { margin: 0 0 14px; }\n  .ccc-pd a { color: #ec287b; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(236,40,123,0.3); }\n  .ccc-pd a:hover { border-bottom-color: #ec287b; }\n  .ccc-pd strong { font-weight: 700; }\n  .ccc-pd .ccc-section-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #999; border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8; padding-bottom: 6px; margin: 22px 0 12px; }\n  .ccc-pd .ccc-trust { background: #fff8fb; border: 1px solid #ebebeb; border-left: 3px solid #ec287b; border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 0 0 18px; color: #444; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .ccc-pd .ccc-trust strong { color: #ec287b; }\n  .ccc-pd .ccc-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin: 12px 0 4px; padding: 0; }\n  .ccc-pd .ccc-chips span { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.03em; color: #ec287b; background: #fff8fb; border: 1px solid #f3cdde; border-radius: 2px; padding: 4px 9px; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .ccc-pd .ccc-warn { background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #ebebeb; border-left: 3px solid #1c1c1c; border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 0 0 18px; color: #444; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"ccc-pd\">\n  <div class=\"ccc-trust\">\n<strong>It's easy being green.</strong> Fresh color, cut to any length you like.</div>\n  <p class=\"ccc-section-label\">Overview</p>\n  <p>Sage is a soft, muted green with warm gray undertones \u2014 calm and versatile against both natural and modern palettes. Order as much or as little of <a href=\"https://www.colorcord.com/collections/diy-wire\">our cloth-covered cord</a> as your project needs.</p>\n  <div class=\"ccc-chips\">\n<span>Sold by the foot</span><span>UL Listed</span><span>1/4\" diameter</span><span>3-conductor</span>\n</div>\n  <p class=\"ccc-section-label\">Construction &amp; Details</p>\n  <p>Our SVT-B wire is built from three conductor wires (positive, negative, and ground) insulated in a PVC housing and finished with Color Cord Company's exclusive cotton blend cloth cover \u2014 a natural matte finish with a softer touch that's more durable than traditional cotton. It is fully UL Listed (file E471255), reflecting our commitment to safe, high-quality products, and is rated to 300V. If you need a two-conductor cord, simply clip the third wire (green) and leave it unused.</p>\n  <p>We recommend ordering 1\u20132 feet more than you think you need to allow for length cuts and wire stripping. Maximum weight rating depends on your final application and assembly. As with all lighting projects and <a href=\"https://www.colorcord.com/blogs/lighting-design-blog/tagged/how-to\">DIY fixture assembly</a>, we recommend consulting a licensed electrician.</p>\n  <p class=\"ccc-section-label\">Before You Order</p>\n  <div class=\"ccc-warn\">Because this wire is UL Listed and cut to order, <strong>we cannot accept returns on cut-to-order wire</strong> for traceability reasons. Please confirm the specifications and color are right for your project before ordering. Monitor settings vary, so colors may differ slightly from your screen \u2014 we recommend <!-- TODO: replace with correct Sage sample variant URL --><a href=\"https://www.colorcord.com/products/color-samples-all-colors-4-length?variant=REPLACE_WITH_SAGE_VARIANT_ID\" title=\"Order a Sage cloth-covered wire sample\">ordering a sample</a> to confirm the true color in person before you buy.</div>\n  <p>New to cloth-covered wire? Our <a href=\"https://www.colorcord.com/blogs/lighting-design-blog/how-to-cut-strip-fabric-covered-wire\" title=\"How to cut and strip cloth-covered wire\">step-by-step cut &amp; strip guide</a> walks you through three easy ways to get a clean, fray-free cut.</p>\n</div>",
