    "body_html": "<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong>Hanging\u00a0Plug-In or\u00a0Ceiling Pendant With Socket</strong></p>\n<p>A pendant\u00a0with socket is a necessary part of any hanging lamp. It\u2019s where your lamp gets its power, but that doesn\u2019t mean it has to be a boring part! Instead, you can easily customize your pendant light for a fun and unique look. Pick\u00a0from a ceiling canopy or a plug.</p>\n<p><strong>Customize Your Pendant Light</strong></p>\n<p>If you want to create a pendant light that\u2019s 100% customizable, this cord set for a hanging lamp is the perfect way to do it. You can choose all the components to make it uniquely yours and help it stand out among all of your decor. The options are endless!</p>\n<p><strong>More Customization</strong></p>\n<p>You might need<span>\u00a0</span><a href=\"https://www.colorcord.com/collections/swag-hooks\">hooks</a><span>\u00a0</span>to hang your brand new pendant light. Shop for everything you need right here to use with your cord set for a hanging lamp.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Choose Plug-In or Hardwired Ceiling Fixture</li>\n<li>Choose Length.</li>\n<li>Price varies depending on length and options.</li>\n<li>Choose thumb switch and position</li>\n<li>Select socket style, color, and finish</li>\n<li>Made with Color Cord Company premium cloth covered wire</li>\n<li>UL Listed File Number: E471215</li>\n<li>7 day production lead time + selected shipping time</li>\n<li>*Due to the customizable nature of this product, we are unable to accept returns on this item.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Need some advice on using the cord set with socket?<span>\u00a0</span><a href=\"https://www.colorcord.com/pages/customer-service\">Chat with us now</a>! Note: raw brass and raw metal finishes are not treated and will oxidize/tarnish over time.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div>",
